{"id":"Q6473112","sci":"Regulidae","ar":null,"ord":{"id":"Q25341","sci":"Passeriformes","ar":"جواثم"},"birds":[{"id":"Q27471","ar":"صعو أحمر العرف","sci":"Regulus ignicapilla","en":"Regulus ignicapilla","iucn":"LC","wdrev":2547957621,"head":"صعو","root":null,"arwiki":{"title":"صعو أحمر العرف","rev":75243263,"text":["صعو أحمر العرف أو صَعوة متوجة بالنار (الاسم العلمي: Regulus  ignicapillus) (الإنجليزية: Common  Firecrest) هو طائر ينتمي إلى صعو (فصيلة: Regulidae)."]},"enwiki":"Common firecrest","image":{"file":"Regulus ignicapilla Frank Vassen.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/Regulus_ignicapilla_Frank_Vassen.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Regulus_ignicapilla_Frank_Vassen.jpg/960px-Regulus_ignicapilla_Frank_Vassen.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Regulus_ignicapilla_Frank_Vassen.jpg","author":"Frank Vassen","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","origin":null},"audio":{"file":"Regulus ignicapilla - Common Firecrest XC432208.mp3","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/Regulus_ignicapilla_-_Common_Firecrest_XC432208.mp3","thumb":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/resources/assets/file-type-icons/fileicon-ogg.png","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Regulus_ignicapilla_-_Common_Firecrest_XC432208.mp3","author":"Joost van Bruggen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","origin":"https://xeno-canto.org/432208"},"audioFromSearch":false,"video":null},{"id":"Q26657","ar":"صعو أصفر العرف","sci":"Regulus regulus","en":"Goldcrest","iucn":"LC","wdrev":2549984751,"head":"صعو","root":null,"arwiki":{"title":"صعو أصفر العرف","rev":76374987,"text":["صعو أصفر العرف أو صَعْوة متوجة بالذهب (الاسم العلمي: Regulus  regulus) (الإنجليزية: Goldcrest) هو طائر ينتمي إلى صعو (فصيلة: Regulidae)."]},"enwiki":"Goldcrest","image":{"file":"Tenerife Goldcrest (Regulus regulus teneriffae) (cropped).JPG","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/Tenerife_Goldcrest_%28Regulus_regulus_teneriffae%29_%28cropped%29.JPG","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/45/Tenerife_Goldcrest_%28Regulus_regulus_teneriffae%29_%28cropped%29.JPG/960px-Tenerife_Goldcrest_%28Regulus_regulus_teneriffae%29_%28cropped%29.JPG","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tenerife_Goldcrest_(Regulus_regulus_teneriffae)_(cropped).JPG","author":"DrPhilippLehmann","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","origin":null},"audio":{"file":"Regulus regulus - Goldcrest XC108347.mp3","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/Regulus_regulus_-_Goldcrest_XC108347.mp3","thumb":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/resources/assets/file-type-icons/fileicon-ogg.png","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Regulus_regulus_-_Goldcrest_XC108347.mp3","author":"Alexander Kurthy","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","origin":"https://xeno-canto.org/108347"},"audioFromSearch":false,"video":null},{"id":"Q1063246","ar":"صعو متوج ذهبي","sci":"Regulus satrapa","en":"Golden-crowned Kinglet","iucn":"LC","wdrev":2533983650,"head":"صعو","root":null,"arwiki":{"title":"صعو متوج ذهبي","rev":61568635,"text":["الصعو المتوج الذهبي (الاسم العلمي: Regulus satrapa) هو طائر مغرد صغير جداً.","الطائر البالغ من هذا النوع يكون لونه مزيجاً من اللون الأخضر الزيتوني والرمادي في أجزاءه العليا وتكون الأجزاء السفلى بيضاء، مع ريش رقيق وذيل قصير. لدى الطائر هذا أيضاً أشرطة بيضاء في جناحيه، وشريط أسود حول عينيه ولديه كذلك ما يشبه التاج باللون الأصفر محاط باللون الأسود. يوجد في الذكور البالغة بقعة برتقالية في منتصف التاج الأصفر.","يتوطن الصعو المتوج الذهبي في الغابات التي بها أشجار الصنوبر في جميع أنحاء كندا، شمال شرق وغرب الولايات المتحدة، المكسيك وأمريكا الوسطى. يعيش الطائر في عش مخفى جيداً معلق في فرع من شجرة الصنوبر.","تهاجر هذه الطيور للولايات المتحدة. تقيم بعض من هذه الطيور بشكل دائم في المناطق الساحلية وخصوصاً في الأجزاء الجنوبية من هذه المناطق. تبقى الطيور الشمالية في الشمال في فصل الشتاء في المناطق التي يتواجد بها الصعو المتوج الروبي."]},"enwiki":"Golden-crowned kinglet","image":{"file":"Regulus satrapa -Canada-8a.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/Regulus_satrapa_-Canada-8a.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Regulus_satrapa_-Canada-8a.jpg/960px-Regulus_satrapa_-Canada-8a.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Regulus_satrapa_-Canada-8a.jpg","author":"Gary Irwin","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","origin":null},"audio":{"file":"Regulus satrapa - Golden-crowned Kinglet XC93427.mp3","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Regulus_satrapa_-_Golden-crowned_Kinglet_XC93427.mp3","thumb":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/resources/assets/file-type-icons/fileicon-ogg.png","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Regulus_satrapa_-_Golden-crowned_Kinglet_XC93427.mp3","author":"Jonathon Jongsma","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","origin":"https://xeno-canto.org/93427"},"audioFromSearch":true,"video":null},{"id":"Q576050","ar":null,"sci":"Regulus calendula","en":"Regulus calendula","iucn":"LC","wdrev":2533981923,"head":null,"root":null,"arwiki":null,"enwiki":null,"image":null,"audio":null,"audioFromSearch":false,"video":null},{"id":"Q716252","ar":null,"sci":"Regulus goodfellowi","en":"Flamecrest","iucn":"LC","wdrev":2538993624,"head":null,"root":null,"arwiki":null,"enwiki":"Flamecrest","image":{"file":"RegulusGoodfellowiLodge.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/26/RegulusGoodfellowiLodge.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/RegulusGoodfellowiLodge.jpg/960px-RegulusGoodfellowiLodge.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:RegulusGoodfellowiLodge.jpg","author":"G E Lodge 